  spellName: Singularity
  description: Every enemy within 6 units is pulled toward you at force 10 and takes
    0.4x weapon damage. They arrive clumped at your feet, staggered by whatever they
    collided with on the way, and your own line is braced against them. Follow with
    anything that hits an area.
